{"steam_appid":1786200,"steam_name":"Wars and Roses","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1786200/431404/eec8c488f81a056ef0b1fb60b7241232f7df888f/1751030752/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1642036743","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256868976/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1642036743","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/ss_1a95200aa5cb48ba91246cf7c45ad88b45f4934d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1658183292","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/ss_514b91727d1210ad0f82b8a7117111baaaa918c8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1658183292","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/ss_e0d79502696e39bac6e5cdba910c3bb35958b0d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1658183292","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/ss_4e1d8a9313d8c180f524bfa5cc8bbaf2bd8aff1a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1658183292","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/ss_8b5d65495803ac6ec26d775fe0402f6190c92947.1920x1080.jpg?t=1658183292"],"about_the_game":"<strong>This is a story of love and war.</strong><br>Do you like military girls? Do you like tactical shooters? Do you like dating sims? Then this game is for you! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/472e2586bac1c61188b6b3d6d497ae10.avif?t=1658183292\" width=500 height=265 /></span><br><br><br>Wars and Roses is a one-of-a-kind intense tactical FPS where you fight battles alongside female officers and interact with those beauties in a 3D dating sim. Rescue captured officers, gain affection by dating in various scenarios to unlock unique interactions and fight side-by-side on an anti-terrorism campaign.<br><br>Win the war and conquer your officers' hearts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An intense close-quarter tactical shooter that features sneaky AI and bullet physics.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/2bf977132160c5bf0688bd72e2e2766f.poster.avif?t=1658183292\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/2bf977132160c5bf0688bd72e2e2766f.webm?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/2bf977132160c5bf0688bd72e2e2766f.mp4?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Beautiful female companions who fight alongside you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/31f9a0573974cbca2b37a272d310c178.poster.avif?t=1658183292\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/31f9a0573974cbca2b37a272d310c178.webm?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/31f9a0573974cbca2b37a272d310c178.mp4?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Date with each female companion and unlock their unique scenarios, dialog, and interactions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/4d55317a1cffc4202c0d16edf2e88b71.poster.avif?t=1658183292\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/4d55317a1cffc4202c0d16edf2e88b71.webm?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/4d55317a1cffc4202c0d16edf2e88b71.mp4?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Fight a global campaign against the terrorists on various maps and missions. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/1794402b2bc84d7f84f15d5f15542a5d.poster.avif?t=1658183292\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/1794402b2bc84d7f84f15d5f15542a5d.webm?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/1794402b2bc84d7f84f15d5f15542a5d.mp4?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Earn money to improve your weapons, skills and buy gifts to impress your companions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/fa8b650e9a3e69ffef5cbe3cdead132d.poster.avif?t=1658183292\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/fa8b650e9a3e69ffef5cbe3cdead132d.webm?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/fa8b650e9a3e69ffef5cbe3cdead132d.mp4?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Recruit more stunning beauties by rescuing them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/daee30943765a5bec1564132391659c6.poster.avif?t=1658183292\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/daee30943765a5bec1564132391659c6.webm?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786200/extras/daee30943765a5bec1564132391659c6.mp4?t=1658183292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><br><strong>Lore</strong><br>Set in a modern-day military world, the all-female private military company &quot;Black Rose&quot; is established to battle a terrorist group hiding worldwide. The player is asked to join and lead the squad after the majority of its members were captured in a recent battle...<br><br><br>Our mission is to redefine the FPS genre by combining two types of games into one. To reward the players with an unprecedented level of sophistication, depth, and fun.","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3210M CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 4790k CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action"],"developers":["Blaze Worlds"],"publishers":["Blaze Worlds"],"release_date":"21 Jan, 2022"}